","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapecollection","title":"MLNShapeCollection","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollection","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShapeCollection"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNPointAnnotation":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointAnnotation"},{"text":" object represents a one-dimensional shape located at a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"single geographical coordinate. Depending on how it is used, an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointAnnotation"},{"text":" object is known as a point annotation or point shape. For","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"example, you could use a point shape to represent a city at low zoom levels, an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"address at high zoom levels, or the location of a long press gesture.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnpointannotation","title":"MLNPointAnnotation","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointAnnotation","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNPointAnnotation"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMultiPolygon":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon"},{"text":" object represents a shape consisting of one or more","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"polygons that do not overlap. For example, you could use a multipolygon shape","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to represent the body of land that consists of an island surrounded by an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"atoll: the inner island would be one ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon"},{"text":" object, while the surrounding","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"atoll would be another. You could also use a multipolygon shape to represent a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"group of disconnected but related buildings.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipolygon","title":"MLNMultiPolygon","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNMultiPolygon"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNPolyline":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolyline","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object represents a shape consisting of two or more vertices,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specified as "},{"code":"CLLocationCoordinate2D","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" instances, and the line segments that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"connect them. For example, you could use an polyline to represent a road or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"path along which something moves."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnpolyline","title":"MLNPolyline","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolyline","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNPolyline","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShape/geoJSONDataUsingEncoding:":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns the GeoJSON string representation of the shape encapsulated in a data"},{"type":"text","text":" "